			},
			"date": "2021-05-10T14:50:14.000Z",
			"content": "Back in the day, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/jrussellsmyth\">@jrussellsmyth</a> and I were 2 of 3 people doing cool things with JS at our large co. They appointed us to this commission to sort of review/recommend. Thanks to reorgs it kept rebooting &amp; I think we must have reviewed 100 takes/libraries over those couple of years\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1150714,
			"parentId": 0,
