			},
			"date": "2021-05-10T14:54:54.000Z",
			"content": "This was a wild time in Web history, right? Very unique.  <a href=\"https://twitter.com/bgalbs\">@bgalbs</a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/dalmaer\">@dalmaer</a> and I have a chat session at upcomming <a href=\"https://twitter.com/search?q=%23blinkOn14\">#blinkOn14</a> where we talk about this time period - maybe you'll relate to/enjoy it too\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/jrussellsmyth\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
