			},
			"date": "2022-06-13T16:02:27.000Z",
			"content": "To be clear I am not actually using your tweet or my thread in the talk itself, just the points.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ChrisFerdinandi\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/RonaldDiemicke\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/alvaro_montoro\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/mikemai2awesome\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
